\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 9 kg (18 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 480 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  480  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_Mobility_SprintForMomentum_ChainShirt</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Mobility_SprintForMomentum_ChainShirt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Mobility_SprintForMomentum_ChainShirt\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">88107048-2ec3-4e48-9670-4d4dd2ca0ff9</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:88107048-2ec3-4e48-9670-4d4dd2ca0ff9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:88107048-2ec3-4e48-9670-4d4dd2ca0ff9\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Sprint_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Sprint (passive feature)\">Sprint</a></dt><dd>Once per turn, the wearer can reduce the duration of their <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Momentum_(Condition)\" title=\"Momentum (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Momentum_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Momentum_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Momentum_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Momentum_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Momentum_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Momentum_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Momentum\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Momentum_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Momentum_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0e/Momentum_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Momentum_(Condition)\" title=\"Momentum (Condition)\">Momentum</a> by 1 turn to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sprint\" title=\"Sprint\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/Sprint_Icon.webp/25px-Sprint_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f4/Sprint_Icon.webp/38px-Sprint_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f4/Sprint_Icon.webp/50px-Sprint_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sprint\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/Sprint_Icon.webp/25px-Sprint_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f4/Sprint_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sprint\" title=\"Sprint\">Sprint</a>.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This item was only obtainable in Early Access. It was found in a chest within a hidden room in the <a href=\"/wiki/Sel%C3%BBnite_Outpost\" title=\"Selûnite Outpost\">Selûnite Outpost</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;175&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-248</span>. This was replaced by <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Luminous_Armour\" title=\"Luminous Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Luminous_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Luminous_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Luminous_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Luminous_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Luminous_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Luminous_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Luminous_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Luminous_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6b/Luminous_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Luminous_Armour\" title=\"Luminous Armour\">Luminous Armour</a> in the full release of the game.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\n<p><i>Regarding Sprint (passive feature):</i></p>\n<p>Does not provoke opportunity attacks.\n</p>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t<li class=\"gallerycaption\">Models</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 98.666666666667px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 96.666666666667px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Chain_of_Liberation_Human_Front_Model.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Body Type 1 Front Human\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/15/Chain_of_Liberation_Human_Front_Model.webp/145px-Chain_of_Liberation_Human_Front_Model.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/15/Chain_of_Liberation_Human_Front_Model.webp/218px-Chain_of_Liberation_Human_Front_Model.webp 1.5x, /w/images/1/15/Chain_of_Liberation_Human_Front_Model.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Chain of Liberation Human Front\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/15/Chain_of_Liberation_Human_Front_Model.webp/145px-Chain_of_Liberation_Human_Front_Model.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/15/Chain_of_Liberation_Human_Front_Model.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Body Type 1 Front <br><a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a></div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 100px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 98px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Chain_of_Liberation_Human_Back_Model.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Body Type 1 Back Human\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Chain_of_Liberation_Human_Back_Model.webp/147px-Chain_of_Liberation_Human_Back_Model.we